From 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChatGPT <noreply@example.com>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hydrogenx: replace dbs governor with schedutil-based v11

Replace the earlier dbs/ondemand-style HydrogenX governor with a real
schedutil-based governor that keeps scheduler update-util callbacks,
IO-wait boost, RT/DL fast max behavior, fast-switch support and MTK
schedutil integration, then layers HydrogenX input/frame/game/IO/GPU/DDR
scene floors on top.

